4. If the issue touches PDL/pipeline/step/scope: `cat docs/design/47-grammar.md` and skim the relevant `StepScope` class under `titan-pipeline-model/src/main/java/io/adaptiq/titan/flow/parser/`. The grammar is SINGLE-SOURCE — see #14 in the enforced-practices chart.
